# Trial by Earth (battlefield.trial_by_earth, Cloister of Tremors, BattlefieldQuest of bastok.trial_by_earth, a C#
# quest; index 0, 30 minutes, 6 players, the Tuning Fork of Earth required, Earth_Protocrystal the exit). A level 75
# Summoner with the quest accepted and the fork. A trade to EP_Entrance (a Chunk of Copper Ore): Trial by Earth wants no
# trade (nor does any fight of the zone with that item): no options, and the zone's IDs.lua has no NO_BATTLEFIELD_ENTRY:
# nothing. The trigger: the menu 32000 (options 1).
# Updates: 0 (index 0, area 0) and 4 (area 4, past the zone's 3 arenas): no fixed area: REQS_NOT_MET; 1 (area 1):
# registered, entered: onBattlefieldEnter takes the fork (requiredKeyItems, no keep), the entry messages; finished.
# Titan_Prime_TBE of arena 1 (GALGALIM-3: below every IDs.lua key) killed: its group's allDeath sets WON; the win
# (BattlefieldQuest:onBattlefieldWin, accepted): battlefieldWin 576, 32001 (canSkipCS 0); finished: no title, no XP
# (the C# quest's 32001 handler: the Whisper of Tremors, Heir of the Great Earth). After the cleanup, out.
lists CloisterOfTremors/EP_Entrance/onTrigger CloisterOfTremors/EP_Entrance/onTrade CloisterOfTremors/onEventUpdate/32000 CloisterOfTremors/onEventFinish/32000 CloisterOfTremors/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=CloisterOfTremors pos=-538.4,0.455,-493.9 job=SMN lvl=75
quest Bastok.TrialByEarth accepted
keyitem TuningForkOfEarth
item ChunkOfCopperOre
login
trade EP_Entrance ChunkOfCopperOre x1   # no fight wants it, no NO_BATTLEFIELD_ENTRY text: nothing
trigger EP_Entrance                     # the fork: the menu 32000
update 32000 option=0                   # 0: ignored
update 32000 option=4                   # index 0, area 4: REQS_NOT_MET
update 32000 option=1                   # area 1: registered, entered, the fork taken
finish                                  # in the arena
kill GALGALIM-3                         # Titan_Prime_TBE of arena 1: WON; 32001
finish                                  # nothing of the battlefield (the quest: the whisper, the title)
tick 11000                              # the won arena's cleanup
tick 10000                              # out of the battlefield
